- The Governing Body shall consist of the following members namely :-
(a)
Minister Incharge, Industries and Commerce Department (Chairperson ex officio) ;
(b)
Minister Incharge, Forest Department (Member, ex officio) ;
(c)
Minister Incharge, Rural Development and Panchayat Raj (Member, ex officio) ;
(d)
Minister Incharge, Public Works (Member, ex-officio) ;
(e)
Administrative Secretary, Industries and Commerce Department (Member Secretary, ex officio) ;
(f)
Administrative Secretary, Planning and Development Department (ex officio) ;
(g)
Director, Geology and Mining Department (Member, ex officio) ;
(h)
Special Invitees having knowledge and experience in Mineral Administration/Exploration to be invited by the
Chairperson.
